WEBVTT


00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:13.640
coffee, there

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:16.600
our bro,

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:17.401
all at once.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.040
Juninho what did you do?

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.080
it's doing business.

00:00:22.081 --> 00:00:22.881
thursday

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.480
it's online bro,

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.655
non-human,

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.440
and then my partner?

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.160
car is clean,

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:02.840
revised engine,

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.520
full tank.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:16.840
when my father died,

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.920
I remember the first thing I did was

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.400
thank God for the time I had with him.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:24.320
I know it's hard,

00:01:24.321 --> 00:01:27.401
but when you learn to be grateful for things

00:01:27.402 --> 00:01:28.361
when they are

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:32.240
and not be moaning when they have to go.

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.160
everything in life is fleeting,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.440
just like you.

00:01:35.441 --> 00:01:36.281
your work,

00:01:36.282 --> 00:01:37.121
his home,

00:01:37.122 --> 00:01:38.121
your dog,

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.120
your car.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:40.840
nothing lasts forever.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:43.640
and today the one leaving is the chevas.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.816
show you then, 

00:01:50.816 --> 00:01:51.360
like this,

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.400
oh then you have a good little step,

00:01:54.401 --> 00:01:55.441
it's not even bad.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.440
moaning things won't solve anything,

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:01.360
the truth will only make them a little more difficult.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:02.800
accepting is freedom.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:06.160
i have more peace when i choose to live this way.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:12.320
Valeu mano,

00:02:12.321 --> 00:02:13.041
success there,

00:02:13.042 --> 00:02:13.841
tamo together

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.440
as well as chevas.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.680
this workshop here

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.360
it's just a way to reach my goal

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.040
to open my business,

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:38.520
but that you will only find out

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.280
at the end of the series.

